'''Celebration Orlando''' was a [[Celebration]] convention. It was held April 13&ndash;16, 2017, at [[Wikipedia:Orlando, Florida|Orlando, Florida's]] [[Wikipedia:Orange County Convention Center|Orange County Convention Center]].<ref name="Celebration 2017 Set for Orlando" /> It was the largest Celebration to date, with over 70,000 attendees.<ref>{{SW|url=news/thank-you-for-an-amazing-star-wars-celebration|text=Thank You for an Amazing ''Star Wars'' Celebration}}</ref>

